    "StudentTasks": "- Students must attend at least 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination. - Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments and labs given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time - Register the IoT Project related to Smart City - Build the team & select/define the project topic with guidance from the teacher - Select the team leader to setup the project management environment on the Gitlab or Github and project document on OneDrive or Google Drive - Student is reponsible to do all Worklabs - Use laptop in class only for learning purpose - Promptly access to the FU LMS at http://flm.fpt.edu.vn for up-to-date course information",
